        "KRISH LTX EXACT-FRAMES V2V\n\n1. Pick your LTX checkpoint in 'Load Checkpoint' and the text encoder in 'Load CLIP' (type: ltxv).\n2. Load your video in 'Load Video'.\n3. Edit the prompt. Lower 'denoise' (0.3-0.6) keeps more of the original.\n4. Run. 'Frame Parity Check' errors if output frame count/size differs from the input.\n\nGreen nodes = Krish Frame Conform pack (custom_nodes/krish_frame_conform)."
